///
/// Unlike [`Prompter`], which manages mutable UI state (cursor
/// coordination, surface pausing), a `PromptRenderer` is a stateless
/// renderer that turns a [`Prompt`] into a [`PromptResult`]. Inject
/// it into display types so the runner module never calls concrete
/// prompt functions directly.
